# Sibling git worktrees. AGENTS.md tells every agent to create one under
# .claude/worktrees/, so without this `format:check` walks into whatever every
# other agent currently has checked out and fails on THEIR in-progress files.
# Worse, the pre-commit hook runs `pnpm run format`, which WRITES — so a commit
# here would silently reformat another agent's working tree.
# eslint.config.js ignores the same path for the same reason; keep the two in step.
#
# Scoped to worktrees/ rather than all of .claude, so tracked settings stay checked.
.claude/worktrees

# Machine-written vibeCompact state. `vibecheck audit` regenerates these on every
# local run, and prettier-formatting them just makes the next run dirty the tree
# again — trends.json failed `format:check` on exactly this loop.
.vibecompact

